── UNKNOWN NAME ─────────────────────────── E0211_rust_vec_type.lt:1:14  [E0211]

Stilt's growable list is `List`, not `Vec`:

  1 │ fn count(xs: Vec<i64>) -> i64 { xs.len() }
    │              ^^^

Stilt's collections are `List`, `Map` and `Set`, which every module sees without
a `use`.

To fix it, write `List`:

  1 │ fn count(xs: List<i64>) -> i64 { xs.len() }
    │              ~~~~
